+/* ------------------------------------------------------- 10-bit probe */
+/*
+ * Which decoders return real P010.  MediaCodecInfo is no guide: the
+ * Snapdragon 855's list omits P010, yet asking for YUV420Flexible gets
+ * Qualcomm's linear Venus P010, while an explicit P010 request is answered
